    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">slide-level classification</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ensuring scalability to high-resolution WSIs. The subsequent subsections detail each architectural component, highlighting how they collectively support efficient and effective multimodal learning</hasEvidenceText>
