    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">foundations were established around 2014 by Variational Autoencoders and Generative Adversarial Networks , which pioneered the synthesis of images from learned latent spaces.</hasEvidenceText>
