    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2.3 Confidence Tiling Scheme for Large-scale Imaging Regarding large-scale virtual staining, conventional methods tend to crop large images into patches for inference and directly concatenate them</hasEvidenceText>
