    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">introduced adversarial training between a generator and a discriminator to produce realistic samples.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">we theorize that such model will be able to learn and replicate the diverse tissue phenotypes contained in whole slide images (WSI)</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
