    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">We then use k-means clustering to retrieve a set C = { c 1 , c 2 , ..., c 128 } of 128 clusters from the feature set Z</hasEvidenceText>
