    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A metric that calculates the Wasserstein-2 distance between multivariate Gaussians fitted to the embedding space of the Inception-v3 network of generated and real images.</skos:skos_definition>
