    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">We propose the Asymmetric Masked Mechanism (AMM) for sparse-grid feature extraction, which randomly samples different fixed number of patches during training and inferenc</hasEvidenceText>
